  "notes": "Dancing wildly and without restraint, typically from intense joy or excitement. Also used figuratively of petals, snow, or sparks whirling through the air.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {歓喜|かんき}の{乱舞|らんぶ}: a dance of joy\n- {花|はな}びらが{乱舞|らんぶ}する: petals whirl about\n- {乱舞|らんぶ}する: to dance wildly\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {舞|ま}う: to dance gracefully — {乱舞|らんぶ} stresses wild, unrestrained motion",
